+---
+"@gpuix/native": patch
+---
+
+Add explicit file-header visibility, cached native diff width measurement and
+independent row/word colors for 1git's read-only viewer. Uses the existing GPUI
+TextSystem::shape_line and Taffy min-width APIs; no GPUI fork change is needed.
+This is a local patch, not a release.
